# Generated by `npx cap sync` — Capacitor rewrites these two from scratch on
# every sync and writes them with LF, while this repo has core.autocrlf=true
# and so expects CRLF in the working tree. The content never actually changes,
# but the mismatch made both files show up as modified in `git status` after
# every sync, cluttering an otherwise clean tree.
#
# Pinning them to LF takes autocrlf out of the loop for these paths: git and
# Capacitor now agree, so no conversion happens and no phantom diff appears.
# Both files say "DO NOT EDIT" on line one, so there is no hand-editing to
# preserve CRLF for.
android/capacitor.settings.gradle   text eol=lf
android/app/capacitor.build.gradle  text eol=lf
